# Flight data is mounted at runtime, never copied into the image. Without this
# line `docker build` would send every recording (gigabytes) to the daemon.
Backend/data
**/.cache

**/node_modules
**/dist
# Windows-generated; would pin the wrong native binaries inside the Linux image.
**/package-lock.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/venv

.git
**/.vscode
**/.idea
.env
